==Strategy==
This stage's difficulty varies based on your [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], so get the ones from Chapter 1 & 2 of [[Cats of the Cosmos]] if you are struggling. The ones from Chapter 3 will make this stage a complete joke.

If you do have most of them, just spam [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and meatshields to first kill the General GreGory, then permafreeze Nimoy Bore until it dies. Then, rush down the Project As with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] or kill them slowly with [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]]. You can also snipe them using Nimoy Bore as a stepping stone, such as by using [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] or [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Major Leaguer Cat]].

==Trivia==
*Ubiquitous Sales is presumably named after [[wikipedia:Ubiquitous computing|ubiquitous computing]], since most [[Singularityville]] stages have technology-related names.

